75:             棣栨鐧诲綍锛氳鐢ㄩ獙璇佸櫒 App 鎵弿鎴栨墜鍔ㄨ緭鍏ュ瘑閽ョ粦瀹?TOTP銆?            <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0aa">otpauth: {{ otpauthUrl.slice(0, 72) }}...</div>
76:             <div style="margin-top: 6px; font-family: monospace; color: #7fe7c4">瀵嗛挜锛歿{ setupSecret }}</div>
77:           </n-alert>
78:           <n-form @keyup.enter="submitCode">
